I rarely write a recommendation for a game. But after experiencing this story. I felt like it was my duty to write a recommendation. Here we go;
It was the best story i have ever seen in a game. I never played a game where it made me cry and a minute later made me laugh my♥♥♥♥♥off.
It is a masterpiece. I feel so much for this game that i can't write enough to express my feelings.
One last thing;
I would name my first born Loader bot.

Before anything else you have to acknowledge that Proteus is not a game like you are used to, it's more like a piece of art. And as a piece of art it is awsome.
-Visuals and music are gorgeus;
-You can "feel" the game (I guess there was some kind of "emotional design" in the development of the game);
-You don't reall play in this game, you just walk arround;
-It's a relaxing experience.
As an art game I think it's perfect! (I wont rate this one because I think it falls in a different category than most other games)

"Atom Zombie Smasher" Recipe:
Take 1/2 cup "Risk”;
Stir in 1/2 cup "Tower Defense";
Add Zombies (or Zeds) to taste;
Heat with Llama Bomb until nice-'n-crispy;
Produces Hours of Strategic Zombie-Nuking Fun!!!

10/10 very fun.
Though servers currently are a pain in the butt and confusing when new to the game.
Wish i had both Depths of hell DLCS tho ;v;
